spice
* SPICE Netlist
VDD 4 0 DC VDD
I_nRD 4 6 DC value
? Missing component
RD 4 3 RD_value
M1 3 7 5 5 NMOS_MODEL
* Node Definitions
* 3 - Output node Vn2,out
* 4 - Connected to VDD and top of RD
* 5 - Ground node
* 6 - Common node for current sources I_nRD and I_n1
* 7 - Gate of M1 (connected to Vb)
* End of netlist
